include ".xcompose.d/inc.xcompose"

#| WinCompose
#| https://github.com/samhocevar/wincompose
#| 
#| This is file auto-loaded by wincompose, it includes the other files.
#| 
#| WinCompose supports the standard Compose file format.
#| It provides more than 1700 compose rules from the Xorg project:
#|    http://www.x.org/wiki/
#| and the dotXCompose project:
#|    https://github.com/kragen/xcompose

#| You can add custom rules by creating a file named .XCompose
#| or .XCompose.txt in your %USERPROFILE% folder.

#| WinCompose must be restarted for changes to take effect.

#| WinCompose stores its state in the dir %APPDATA%\wincompose\ 
#| * settings.ini (contains the settings)
#| * metadata.xml (contains all the metadata associated with sequences)
